{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "面口合谷收：面部、口部病可取合谷；面瘫等常取合谷。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c01", "evidence_quote": "面部的病，口部的病都可以在颌骨上下针", "seg_from": 1, "seg_to": 4, "start_s": 18.36, "end_s": 34.69, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=18s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 18.36, "end_s": 34.69}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "颌骨=合谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "面部透针较痛时，先针对侧合谷再透刺，痛感可明显减轻。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c01", "evidence_quote": "先下颌骨，下完颌骨以后再去透", "seg_from": 7, "seg_to": 15, "start_s": 45.89, "end_s": 103.885, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=45s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 45.89, "end_s": 103.89}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "颌骨=合谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "曲池用途广，肩痛、皮肤痒等常取；其下两寸为手三里。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li11", "acupoint.li10"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c01", "evidence_quote": "肩膀痛啊、皮肤痒啊都在曲子上下症", "seg_from": 17, "seg_to": 18, "start_s": 108.72, "end_s": 125.85, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=108s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 108.72, "end_s": 125.85}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "曲子/曲直=曲池", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "手三里又称扭伤穴，治急性腰扭伤、落枕；针后令患者活动患处至松解再出针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li10", "new.acupoint.扭伤穴", "acupoint.ex_lao_zhen"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c01", "evidence_quote": "扭伤穴针下去，针下去以后一边脸左右", "seg_from": 19, "seg_to": 25, "start_s": 126.75, "end_s": 163.68, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=126s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 126.75, "end_s": 163.68}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "一边脸左右=令活动", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "手五里深处有大动脉，一般禁针，知位置即可。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li13"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c02", "evidence_quote": "因为里面有大动脉，好，我们竞争", "seg_from": 73, "seg_to": 74, "start_s": 428.17, "end_s": 439.455, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=428s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 428.17, "end_s": 439.45}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "竞争=禁针", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "手挛握难伸时，可自合谷透向后溪（三寸针），常可使之开伸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4", "acupoint.si3"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c02", "evidence_quote": "从颌骨一路透到后期", "seg_from": 96, "seg_to": 103, "start_s": 529.97, "end_s": 593.55, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=529s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 529.97, "end_s": 593.55}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "颌骨=合谷；后期=后溪", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "禾髎在鼻孔下唇上中线旁，主鼻病；迎香在鼻旁开五分，为大肠经末穴，治鼻不闻香臭。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li19", "acupoint.li20", "meridian.li"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c02", "evidence_quote": "鼻子鼻旁开五分，这个穴道我们叫做迎香穴", "seg_from": 184, "seg_to": 192, "start_s": 1001.53, "end_s": 1054.36, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=1001s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 1001.53, "end_s": 1054.36}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "合疗=禾髎；银香/营香=迎香", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0008", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "迎香治鼻塞、鼻窦炎宜透刺（勿直深刺无效）；可先针对侧合谷。面部穴只针不灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li20", "acupoint.li4"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c02", "evidence_quote": "脸上呢都是下针，不揪好", "seg_from": 207, "seg_to": 222, "start_s": 1131.19, "end_s": 1209.78, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=1131s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 1131.19, "end_s": 1209.78}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "不揪=不灸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-019.kp0009", "video_id": "zj-019", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "手之阳经自四肢末梢走向躯干，足之阳经自躯干走向四肢末梢；可以穴序记经气流向。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.li"], "chapter_id": "zj-019.c02", "evidence_quote": "手上的阳是由四四末梢往身上走", "seg_from": 241, "seg_to": 243, "start_s": 1296.99, "end_s": 1319.245, "citation": {"youtube_id": "OfgWKd6YErA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfgWKd6YErA&t=1296s", "series": "zj", "episode": 19, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 19", "start_s": 1296.99, "end_s": 1319.24}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
